                                                "sense_id": "facab184-e36e-3ff9-ac87-67ac46a0a5a6",
                                                "text": "Mann was a vocal leader in the group, and she was particularly outspoken about an incident in which the school's rugby team engaged in chants calling for violence against women -- including rape and necrophilia."
